> Interpretation and limits

ASCII A-Z is folded deterministically; Unicode code points are not decoded.
Spaces remain ordinary bytes plus the stated padding. This convention resembles
trigram search tools but does not promise PostgreSQL tokenization or scoring
semantics.

Every figure is saved locally by its complete editable program. No separate
reconstruction supplies algorithm state. Counters describe the selected events,
not elapsed time or peak memory.

